chronicle :chronicle_1769918846130_oe1kyq do
  source_id "chronicle_1769918846130_oe1kyq"
  title "The City that Grew Fat on Fire"
  summary "In the underground city of ☽'slew Nisaemesius~, the master penguin Retenusus learns the forbidden Shawl of the Sun magic, which allows him to burn away corrupted memories from ice but at the cost of his own memories. Despite three warnings from the ice itself, Retenusus and his followers, the Sun-Shawled, continue burning away memories deeper into the tunnels, causing catastrophic structural damage. When Retenusus attempts one final burning in the sealed Lower Galleries, the ice catastrophically fails, releasing superheated steam that kills a thousand penguins and destroys the colony's delicate balance. The fable warns that the clever ones cannot stop digging, and that what is burned away in darkness cannot be returned."
